  "published": "2026-11-05T12:00:30.867Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: Geolocation on Camera — GetGeoLocationAsync and SetGeoLocationAsync, with the ONVIF *Specified flags honoured so a coordinate the camera did not report is absent rather than zero. Device I/O live state: DeviceIoStateWatcher opens a topic-filtered pull point on Device/Trigger/Relay and Device/Trigger/DigitalInput, where the Initialized snapshot gives each relay's and input's current state and Changed gives every update, and keeps it as a TryGetState snapshot with a change event. DeviceIoState carries a relay's logical state and contact. The probe gains geolocation steps and shows live relay and input state. New unit tests project (not packaged).",
